flowchart LR
  Interview --> Design
  Design -->|Human design approval| Spec
  Spec -->|Validated specification| Plan[Plan and issues]
  Plan -->|Human implementation authorization| Work[Model-led implementation and repair]
  Work --> Evidence[Requested checks and independent reviews]
  Evidence -->|Current required proof or scoped exceptions| Acceptance[Human acceptance]
  Acceptance -->|Exact action authorization and protected check| Merge[Observed integration]
  Merge -->|Finalization and retained evidence| Complete
  Evidence -->|Findings or stale proof| Work
